# Agent Handoff Protocol

Spec: AgentHandoff
Purpose:
  Define how agents pass work to each other. Context is NOT copied;
  it is reassembled by the receiving agent via the context compiler.

Owns: agents/handoff.sdd

HandoffPackage:
  @handoff.H22
  done:
    - domain
    - service
  pending:
    - integration test
  important:
    - transaction boundary changed
  risk: high
  next: run integration verification

ContextPrinciple:
  DO NOT: Agent A context → copy → Agent B
  DO: TASK + STATE + REFERENCES + HANDOFF
  Agent B reassembles context via context compiler

ContextHandoffFields:
  task: linked task ID
  state: implementation milestone reached
  references: @decision, @architecture, @skill IDs
  proof: what passed/failed
  unknown: [open questions for next agent]

State: +
